#25000
&08The Nine Hells&00 - Plane of Avernus~
Hell will consist of 9 planes stacked upon one another like a deck
of cards. Each plane will be able to be travelled via protected gates
on each plane. But, players will be able to traverse all the planes
without having to travel them in sequence if they know the way.

Avernus is the uppermost plane of Hell..a veritable wasteland which serves
as a *gate* to Hell and a place of banishment for many demons of the
other Hells. Its Arch Devil is none other than Tiamat herself, feared
by most of the Hells and respected by all. She dwells in the caverns,
feeding and mating with her chromatic consorts. Throughout Hell players
may encounter various banished characters, DT's, and mazes. So though
it may be the top most plane..it by no means is easier than any other.


~
250 2 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
