and you begin to question the choices you once deemed sound.  The heat
and desolation of your surroundings suddenly overwhelms you with the
desire for a swift and painless death rather than the grueling torture
Avernus bestows on its unsuspecting adventurers.  For Hell is the
most unforgiving infernal you will ever know!
~
