#25087
The Hideaway~
  Piles of riches illuminate the floor in the only chamber that has
not fallen to raid by Nergal.  Battle plans cover the worn benches lining
the walls.  Upon closer inspection, you discover a tablet securely
fastened to the underside of the bench in the far corner.
~
