#25089
A Crack in the Rock~
  Before you stands a massive wall of rock spanning 100 feet wide and
several hundred feet high.  As you scan your eyes over the monstrosity you
spot a small crack in the southern face.  Blood appears to be oozing out of
this crevice, as the markings of a wild animal appear to have been carved
into the stone.
~
